# Copy to .env.local (local) or .env (optional). Do not commit this file with a real token.
# https://github.com/settings/tokens — classic PAT: `repo` (read) for private repos + checks/PRs.
# Fine-grained: Contents (read), Metadata (read), Pull requests (read), Actions (read) as needed.
# Runtime: set GITHUB_TOKEN in Docker/Swarm or Railway (not build-time) so server fetches stay authenticated.
# Railway: add GITHUB_TOKEN (+ optional GITHUB_USER) in the service Variables tab.
# Security: see docs/SECURITY-ENV.md

GITHUB_TOKEN=
GITHUB_USER=duketopceo

# Optional: Cloudflare API token for scripts/audit-cloudflare.sh (Zone + DNS + Settings read; not used by the app)
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=

# Optional: Notion AI Brain seed (npm run notion:seed). Not loaded by Next.js — export in shell or use `set -a; source .env.local`.
# Create an internal integration, share the database with it. DB must match public/podcast/tools/notion/database-spec.md
# NOTION_API_KEY=secret_...
# NOTION_AI_BRAIN_DATABASE_ID=
